/* Loop-invariant code motion in a frame too large for the pass to track.
 *
 * LICM keeps a table of the locals a loop body writes and hoists an
 * expression only when every local it reads is absent from that table.
 * A function with more locals than the table holds used to read as
 * "not written" for the ones that did not fit, so `i * 5` came out of
 * the loop and every iteration stored the same value. The values below
 * are the ones the arithmetic gives, so the case fails loudly rather
 * than quietly agreeing with a miscompile. */
